      "ws_voice_1_0#2": [
        {
          "Name": "voice_0",
          "Sound": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_eventstory_8_06_055.wav",
          "Command": "lip_sync enforce",
          "PostCommand": "lip_sync enable; start_mtn ournotes_l2d_carrier_sub_shizukus_mother ws_manual_voice_finished_1#9",
          "Priority": 9,
          "Interruptable": true,
          "Text": "『四宮寧月』が、あんなどこの馬の骨とも知らない\n下流の人間と同じものを選ぶなんて、あってはならないの"
        },
        {
          "Name": "voice_1",
          "Sound": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_eventstory_8_06_054.wav",
          "Command": "lip_sync enforce",
          "PostCommand": "lip_sync enable; start_mtn ournotes_l2d_carrier_sub_shizukus_mother ws_manual_voice_finished_1#9",
          "Priority": 9,
          "Interruptable": true,
          "Text": "いい？　あなたはクラシック界の神童であり\n音楽家『四宮絃一郎』の娘なのよ"
        },
        {
          "Name": "voice_2",
          "Sound": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_eventstory_8_06_079.wav",
          "Command": "lip_sync enforce",
          "PostCommand": "lip_sync enable; start_mtn ournotes_l2d_carrier_sub_shizukus_mother ws_manual_voice_finished_1#9",
          "Priority": 9,
          "Interruptable": true,
          "Text": "ええ、そうなんです。\n自由時間はバルコニーで読書をしているんですのよ"
        },
        {
          "Name": "voice_3",
          "Sound": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_eventstory_8_06_044.wav",
          "Command": "lip_sync enforce",
          "PostCommand": "lip_sync enable; start_mtn ournotes_l2d_carrier_sub_shizukus_mother ws_manual_voice_finished_1#9",
          "Priority": 9,
          "Interruptable": true,
          "Text": "ズボンも素敵だけれど、\nお母さまはこれが寧月に似合うと思うわ"
        },
        {
          "Name": "voice_4",
          "Sound": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_eventstory_8_06_058.wav",
          "Command": "lip_sync enforce",
          "PostCommand": "lip_sync enable; start_mtn ournotes_l2d_carrier_sub_shizukus_mother ws_manual_voice_finished_1#9",
          "Priority": 9,
          "Interruptable": true,
          "Text": "ここから正解を選べるようになるまで\nレッスンです。いいわね"
        },
        {
          "Name": "voice_5",
          "Sound": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_eventstory_8_06_064.wav",
          "Command": "lip_sync enforce",
          "PostCommand": "lip_sync enable; start_mtn ournotes_l2d_carrier_sub_shizukus_mother ws_manual_voice_finished_1#9",
          "Priority": 9,
          "Interruptable": true,
          "Text": "不正解。もっとよく考えなさい。\n『四宮寧月』にふさわしいものよ"
        },
        {
          "Name": "voice_6",
          "Sound": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_eventstory_8_06_048.wav",
          "Command": "lip_sync enforce",
          "PostCommand": "lip_sync enable; start_mtn ournotes_l2d_carrier_sub_shizukus_mother ws_manual_voice_finished_1#9",
          "Priority": 9,
          "Interruptable": true,
          "Text": "ふふ、やっぱり。\nではこの形で。次は生地を選びましょう"
        },
        {
          "Name": "voice_7",
          "Sound": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_eventstory_8_06_062.wav",
          "Command": "lip_sync enforce",
          "PostCommand": "lip_sync enable; start_mtn ournotes_l2d_carrier_sub_shizukus_mother ws_manual_voice_finished_1#9",
          "Priority": 9,
          "Interruptable": true,
          "Text": "このページの中で、あなたが選ぶ『好きなもの』はどれ？"
        },
        {
          "Name": "voice_8",
          "Sound": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_eventstory_8_06_033.wav",
          "Command": "lip_sync enforce",
          "PostCommand": "lip_sync enable; start_mtn ournotes_l2d_carrier_sub_shizukus_mother ws_manual_voice_finished_1#9",
          "Priority": 9,
          "Interruptable": true,
          "Text": "まあ、どれも素敵ねえ。\n寧月はどれが好きかしら？"
        },
        {
          "Name": "voice_9",
          "Sound": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_eventstory_8_06_069.wav",
          "Command": "lip_sync enforce",
          "PostCommand": "lip_sync enable; start_mtn ournotes_l2d_carrier_sub_shizukus_mother ws_manual_voice_finished_1#9",
          "Priority": 9,
          "Interruptable": true,
          "Text": "よかったわねえ。\n好きなものを選んでいいって"
